  "notes": "<p>Presentation of the wind lidar ontology viewer available at <a title=\"here\" href=\"https://data.windenergy.dtu.dk/ontologies/view/ontolidar/en/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Wind lidar ontology viewer</a>. In this presentation a lidar ontology application tool, available at <a href=\"https://github.com/IEAWindTask52/Extract-lidar-ontology-concepts\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">GitHub Lidar Ontology Tool</a>, is referenced. It provides insights into how this application enhances the understanding and utilization of wind lidar ontology concepts.</p>",
